OL,3,GNEWSACrown Office communication in
OL,4,Adomestic abuse cases 'remains poor' -
OL,5,Areport
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's prosecution service still
OL,8,Fneeds to improve its communication with
OL,9,Fdomestic abuse survivors, a watchdog
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FA report from His Majesty's
OL,13,FInspectorate of Prosecution in Scotland
OL,14,F(IPS) two years ago found the provision
OL,15,Fof basic information was inadequate.
OL,17,FA follow-up review has now revealed
OL,18,Fthat while there have been some
OL,19,Fpositive developments, the overall
OL,20,Fstandard of communication with victims
OL,21,F"remains poor".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
