OL,3,GNEWSACrown Office communication in
OL,4,Adomestic abuse cases 'remains poor' -
OL,5,Areport
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Crown Office and Procurator Fiscal
OL,8,FService (COPFS) said it had worked on
OL,9,Fdelivering improvements, but accepted
OL,10,Fthat these had not been consistent for
OL,11,Fall victims.
